Use only statuses appropriate to the gateway and actual transaction lifecycle.

Keep payment status separate from order fulfillment status.

Recommended order lifecycle:

- PENDING
- CONFIRMED
- PROCESSING
- PACKED
- SHIPPED
- OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
- DELIVERED
- COMPLETED
- CANCELLED
